the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    the calculation date is *a date*; scenario element.
    the first determination disqualification period years is *a number*.
    the second determination disqualification period years is *a number*.
    the first determination occasion number is *a number*.
    the second determination occasion number is *a number*.
    the third determination occasion number is *a number*.
    the controlled substance first finding occasion number is *a number*.
    the controlled substance second finding occasion number is *a number*.
    the firearms ammunition or explosives first finding occasion number is *a number*.
    the section 2024 item value permanent disqualification threshold is *an amount*.
    *a person* is intentional program violation determination.
    *a person* is ineligible for one year.
    *a person* is ineligible for two years.
    *a person* is permanently ineligible.
    *a person* is ineligible for further participation.
    *a household* is household barred from increased benefits due to member disqualification.
    *a person* is found by state or federal court or administrative agency; scenario element.
    *a person* is intentionally made false or misleading statement or misrepresented concealed or withheld facts; scenario element.
    *a person* is intentionally committed act constituting violation of chapter regulations or state statute; scenario element.
    the act of *a person* was for purpose of using presenting transferring acquiring receiving or possessing program benefits; scenario element.
    the determination occasion number of *a person* is *a number*; scenario element.
    *a person* is federal state or local court finding of trading controlled substance for benefits; scenario element.
    the controlled substance trading finding occasion number of *a person* is *a number*; scenario element.
    *a person* is federal state or local court finding of trading firearms ammunition or explosives for benefits; scenario element.
    the firearms ammunition or explosives trading finding occasion number of *a person* is *a number*; scenario element.
    *a person* is convicted of offense under 7 usc 2024 b or c involving item covered by 7 usc 2024 b or c; scenario element.
    the section 2024 item value of *a person* is *an amount*; scenario element.
    *a household* has member disqualified under this subsection during period of ineligibility; scenario element.

