% 7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1) — us:statutes/7/2015/b/1
the text of "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(i)" is at "sources/us/statutes/7/2015/b/1.yaml".

the text of "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(ii)" is at "sources/us/statutes/7/2015/b/1.yaml".

the text of "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(ii)(I)" is at "sources/us/statutes/7/2015/b/1.yaml".

the text of "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(iii)(I)" is at "sources/us/statutes/7/2015/b/1.yaml".

the text of "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(ii)(II)" is at "sources/us/statutes/7/2015/b/1.yaml".

the text of "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(iii)(II)" is at "sources/us/statutes/7/2015/b/1.yaml".

the text of "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(iii)(III)" is at "sources/us/statutes/7/2015/b/1.yaml".

the text of "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(iii)(IV)" is at "sources/us/statutes/7/2015/b/1.yaml".

the text of "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)" is at "sources/us/statutes/7/2015/b/1.yaml".

the text of "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(iii)" is at "sources/us/statutes/7/2015/b/1.yaml".

rule first_determination_disqualification_period_years with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(i)":
the first determination disqualification period years is 1 if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D.

rule second_determination_disqualification_period_years with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(ii)":
the second determination disqualification period years is 2 if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D.

rule first_determination_occasion_number with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(i)":
the first determination occasion number is 1 if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D.

rule second_determination_occasion_number with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(ii)(I)":
the second determination occasion number is 2 if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D.

rule third_determination_occasion_number with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(iii)(I)":
the third determination occasion number is 3 if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D.

rule controlled_substance_first_finding_occasion_number with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(ii)(II)":
the controlled substance first finding occasion number is 1 if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D.

rule controlled_substance_second_finding_occasion_number with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(iii)(II)":
the controlled substance second finding occasion number is 2 if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D.

rule firearms_ammunition_or_explosives_first_finding_occasion_number with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(iii)(III)":
the firearms ammunition or explosives first finding occasion number is 1 if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D.

rule section_2024_item_value_permanent_disqualification_threshold with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(iii)(IV)":
the section 2024 item value permanent disqualification threshold is 500 if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D.

rule intentional_program_violation_determination_1 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)":
a person is intentional program violation determination if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D
    and the person is found by state or federal court or administrative agency
    and the person is intentionally made false or misleading statement or misrepresented concealed or withheld facts
    and the act of the person was for purpose of using presenting transferring acquiring receiving or possessing program benefits.

rule intentional_program_violation_determination_2 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)":
a person is intentional program violation determination if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D
    and the person is found by state or federal court or administrative agency
    and the person is intentionally committed act constituting violation of chapter regulations or state statute
    and the act of the person was for purpose of using presenting transferring acquiring receiving or possessing program benefits.

rule ineligible_for_one_year with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(i)":
a person is ineligible for one year if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D
    and the person is intentional program violation determination
    and the determination occasion number of the person is a number N
    and the first determination occasion number is a number M
    and N = M.

rule ineligible_for_two_years_1 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(ii)":
a person is ineligible for two years if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D
    and the person is intentional program violation determination
    and the determination occasion number of the person is a number N
    and the second determination occasion number is a number M
    and N = M.

rule ineligible_for_two_years_2 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(ii)":
a person is ineligible for two years if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D
    and the person is federal state or local court finding of trading controlled substance for benefits
    and the controlled substance trading finding occasion number of the person is a number N
    and the controlled substance first finding occasion number is a number M
    and N = M.

rule permanently_ineligible_1 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(iii)":
a person is permanently ineligible if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D
    and the person is intentional program violation determination
    and the determination occasion number of the person is a number N
    and the third determination occasion number is a number M
    and N >= M.

rule permanently_ineligible_2 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(iii)":
a person is permanently ineligible if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D
    and the person is federal state or local court finding of trading controlled substance for benefits
    and the controlled substance trading finding occasion number of the person is a number N
    and the controlled substance second finding occasion number is a number M
    and N >= M.

rule permanently_ineligible_3 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(iii)":
a person is permanently ineligible if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D
    and the person is federal state or local court finding of trading firearms ammunition or explosives for benefits
    and the firearms ammunition or explosives trading finding occasion number of the person is a number N
    and the firearms ammunition or explosives first finding occasion number is a number M
    and N >= M.

rule permanently_ineligible_4 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)(iii)":
a person is permanently ineligible if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D
    and the person is convicted of offense under 7 usc 2024 b or c involving item covered by 7 usc 2024 b or c
    and the section 2024 item value of the person is an amount N
    and the section 2024 item value permanent disqualification threshold is an amount M
    and N >= M.

rule ineligible_for_further_participation_1 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)":
a person is ineligible for further participation if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D
    and the person is ineligible for one year.

rule ineligible_for_further_participation_2 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)":
a person is ineligible for further participation if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D
    and the person is ineligible for two years.

rule ineligible_for_further_participation_3 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)":
a person is ineligible for further participation if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D
    and the person is permanently ineligible.

rule household_barred_from_increased_benefits_due_to_member_disqualification with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(b)(1)":
a household is household barred from increased benefits due to member disqualification if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D
    and the household has member disqualified under this subsection during period of ineligibility.

scenario first_intentional_program_violation_causes_one_year_ineligibility is, as stated in "sources/us/statutes/7/2015/b/1.test.yaml" at case 1:
    person_1 is a person.
    the calculation date is 2026-01-01.
    the act of person_1 was for purpose of using presenting transferring acquiring receiving or possessing program benefits.
    the controlled substance trading finding occasion number of person_1 is 0.
    the determination occasion number of person_1 is 1.
    the firearms ammunition or explosives trading finding occasion number of person_1 is 0.
    person_1 is found by state or federal court or administrative agency.
    person_1 is intentionally made false or misleading statement or misrepresented concealed or withheld facts.
    the section 2024 item value of person_1 is 0.
    q_controlled_substance_first_finding_occasion_number expects answers ["the controlled substance first finding occasion number is 1"].
    q_controlled_substance_second_finding_occasion_number expects answers ["the controlled substance second finding occasion number is 2"].
    q_firearms_ammunition_or_explosives_first_finding_occasion_number expects answers ["the firearms ammunition or explosives first finding occasion number is 1"].
    q_first_determination_disqualification_period_years expects answers ["the first determination disqualification period years is 1"].
    q_first_determination_occasion_number expects answers ["the first determination occasion number is 1"].
    q_second_determination_disqualification_period_years expects answers ["the second determination disqualification period years is 2"].
    q_second_determination_occasion_number expects answers ["the second determination occasion number is 2"].
    q_section_2024_item_value_permanent_disqualification_threshold expects answers ["the section 2024 item value permanent disqualification threshold is 500"].
    q_third_determination_occasion_number expects answers ["the third determination occasion number is 3"].

scenario first_controlled_substance_trading_finding_causes_two_year_ineligibility is, as stated in "sources/us/statutes/7/2015/b/1.test.yaml" at case 2:
    person_1 is a person.
    the calculation date is 2026-01-01.
    the controlled substance trading finding occasion number of person_1 is 1.
    the determination occasion number of person_1 is 0.
    person_1 is federal state or local court finding of trading controlled substance for benefits.
    the firearms ammunition or explosives trading finding occasion number of person_1 is 0.
    the section 2024 item value of person_1 is 0.
    q_ineligible_for_further_participation expects answers ["person_1 is ineligible for further participation"].
    q_ineligible_for_one_year expects answers [].
    q_ineligible_for_two_years expects answers ["person_1 is ineligible for two years"].
    q_intentional_program_violation_determination expects answers [].
    q_permanently_ineligible expects answers [].

