    the calculation date is 2026-01-01.
    the controlled substance trading finding occasion number of person_1 is 0.
    the determination occasion number of person_1 is 0.
    person_1 is federal state or local court finding of trading firearms ammunition or explosives for benefits.
    the firearms ammunition or explosives trading finding occasion number of person_1 is 1.
    the section 2024 item value of person_1 is 0.
    q_ineligible_for_further_participation expects answers ["person_1 is ineligible for further participation"].
