    q_permanently_ineligible expects answers ["person_1 is permanently ineligible"].

scenario household_cannot_receive_increased_benefits_due_to_member_disqualification is, as stated in "sources/us/statutes/7/2015/b/1.test.yaml" at case 4:
    household_1 is a household.
    the calculation date is 2026-01-01.
    household_1 has member disqualified under this subsection during period of ineligibility.
    q_household_barred_from_increased_benefits_due_to_member_disqualification expects answers ["household_1 is household barred from increased benefits due to member disqualification"].

